DESCRIPTION:Join us this Sunday afternoon for an absolute ear hole party wi
 th two bands hailing from Meanjin/Brisbane – The Snouts & Revelation Gro
 ove Live in the Arcade First up is eight-piece Revelation Groove. These be
 autiful humans will treat us with their blend of Latin-jazz-funk-soul-blue
 s with keyboards\, accordion\, bass\, guitar\, saxophone\, percussion\, vi
 olin\, drums and sweet\, sweet vocal harmonies. @revelationgroove revelati
 ongroove.bandcamp.com Then the Snouts return to their Brisbane trough in t
 he Netherworld! This semi-wholesome 5 piece gorges on raucous energetic pu
 nk and classic ska. Their infectious live energy will cure what ails you o
 n a Sunday afternoon. @thesnoutsband http://thesnouts1.bandcamp.com Grab a
  drink and meet us in the arcade from 3pm to get your skank on! Free to jo
 in in with the Netherworld open from midday for pre-gig beers\, burgers an
 d games.
